{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgom1uPptL5mSuVkcCje2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't give you a pick from this page. It's a directory, not a comparison. Pretty sure of that, because none of the four screens shows a single fee.\n\n**What decided it:** I came for one number per broker, something like the monthly account fee, buy commission or FX rate. What I got is a list of names. The banks section only says each one has a \"תעריפון מ־01.10.2026\" behind its arrow. The actual numbers are presumably inside those rows or under the \"לפי מוצר\" tab, and I can't get there from these screenshots.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: \"מה חברה מציעה לי\", a search box, then a \"בתי השקעות\" grid. It lists IBI, Altshuler, Interactive Israel, IBKR, Meitav and so on, each tagged with the products it offers. No numbers, so I scrolled.\n2. \"בנקים ובתי השקעות נוספים\": Hapoalim, Leumi, Discount, Mizrahi, One Zero, Pepper and others. Each one shows a fee-schedule date. That's the only screen with anything I could use, and it's a date, not a fee. Bank Jerusalem, Mizrahi and פסגות say \"ללא תאריך פרסום\", which looks like a warning but isn't explained.\n3. Fund issuers and index providers (BlackRock, iShares, S&P Dow Jones…), each with a count, in closed folds. The labels weren't about costs, so I didn't open them.\n4. \"לא נכלל כלל\". I read the heading and skimmed the paragraph. The footer says \"אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\". That's the first reason to trust the site at all.\n\n**What I skipped:** the product tags on each company, the issuer and index folds, and \"כל הרשומות · 9\".\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- The jump from screen 2 to screen 3 skips a chunk. A row above \"ריט 1\" is cut off, so I may have missed something there.\n- I can't tell whether \"IBI\" in the broker grid and \"פסגות\" are the same kind of account as the bank ones. They're filed under different sections, which might mean the broker houses have no fee schedule on file here.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- I'm a minute in and there's not one shekel figure. If I can't see what Leumi charges next to what IBKR charges, I can't compare anything.\n- Two different taxonomies on one page: brokers are tagged by products, banks by fee-schedule date.\n- Plus side: no broker is pushed at me and it says it has no affiliate links, so I'm not suspicious, just underfed.\n\nWould I close the tab? On this view, yes, at the bottom of the banks list. Before leaving I'd click one bank row and the \"לפי מוצר\" tab, because that's where the numbers might be."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1915,"cache_read_input_tokens":9582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1915},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1515d30e-2c16-440c-a5a3-31c794ec341c","uuid":"ebedfd19-d52f-4298-8a18-b2360c89aee6","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:54:37.926Z","request_id":"req_011Cgom1uBBiJMX8EB74ZGQe"}
